/P 283 0 R
/E (This project proposes a decentralized Federated Learning framework for multi-satellite swarms to autonomously detect subsystem anomalies, generate real-time health scores, and predict subsystem failures through cluster-level weight collaboration. The architecture utilizes robust aggregation to identify and remove faulty node updates while providing automated ground alerts for proactive failure management without ground-station dependency.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
