endobj
399 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 284 0 R
/T (Having ZOH channels with 1 feature and aggregate channels with 5 features creates non-uniform input tensors which are incompatible with standard GNN architectures like GDN.)
/E (Having ZOH channels with 1 feature and aggregate channels with 5 features creates non-uniform input tensors which are incompatible with standard GNN architectures like GDN.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
400 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 284 0 R
/E (Reprocessed all 76 channels to produce 5 uniform features \(mean, max, min, std, count\) per 30 s window. ZOH channels produce degenerate values \(std=0, count=1\) which are themselves informative signals.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
